  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### How do I process a manual bank reconciliation?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 17 Nov, 2021 at  4:20 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: Bookkeeping > Settings > Company Info\n\nLocation 2: Bookkeeping >Bank > Dashboard >> Select Bank Account\n\nClick here to watch how to manually reconcile bank transactions\n\nHelp/Guide: \n\nFirst choose the option for manual Bank reconciliation available under \n\nBookkeeping>>Settings>>Company Info>>Settings Tab. \n\nOnce done, head to Bookkeeping>>Bank>> Dashboard >> Select Bank Account\n\nOption 1. \n\nSelect Cash Coding from the top corner\n\nThis will take you to this page where you can reconcile all 'unexplained' transactions by clicking the tick box to the left\n\nOption 2:\n\nOn the bank homepage \n\n Select match status as all from the dropdown\nIf the status is UnMatched-Match the transaction using the dropdown button under Action\nIf the status is Matched, click the button to the left and then click the blue reconcile button \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115344\">Bookkeeping</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188520\">Bookkeeping FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How do I process a manual bank reconciliation?\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 17 Nov, 2021 at  4:20 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Location:</span></strong> Bookkeeping &gt; Settings &gt; Company Info</span></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Location 2:&nbsp;</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Bookkeeping &gt;Bank &gt; Dashboard &gt;&gt; Select Bank Account</span></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"https://www.useloom.com/share/3317839bae274193aea96e6c369ea349\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Click here to watch how to manually reconcile bank transactions</strong></span></a></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Help/Guide:</strong>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">First choose the option for manual Bank reconciliation available under&nbsp;</span></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Bookkeeping&gt;&gt;Settings&gt;&gt;Company Info&gt;&gt;Settings Tab.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073982793/original/RkChQpB6sZtBObNbYaYzWuBr-B_6ntiYsg.png?1553248261\" width=\"602\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9073982793/original/RkChQpB6sZtBObNbYaYzWuBr-B_6ntiYsg.png?1553248261\" data-fileid=\"9073982793\" data-uniquekey=\"1553248251363\" style=\"width: 1080px;\"></p><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once done, head to <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Bookkeeping&gt;&gt;Bank&gt;&gt; Dashboard &gt;&gt; Select Bank Account</span></span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Option 1.</strong>&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">Select Cash Coding from the top corner</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137420714/original/ozbHMTsphvk36w-ipTXokmu6S8-xcRQs7A.png?1629385512\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137420714\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">This will take you to this page where you can reconcile all 'unexplained' transactions by clicking the tick box to the left</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137420795/original/MwSkLg_QZKl5hDrYpqsGyoVyHEnoX8uL7w.png?1629385557\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137420795\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Option 2:</strong></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">On the bank homepage&nbsp;</p><ol><li dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;Select match status as all from the dropdown</li><li dir=\"ltr\">If the status is UnMatched-Match the transaction using the dropdown button under Action</li><li dir=\"ltr\">If the status is Matched, click the button to the left and then click the blue reconcile button&nbsp;</li></ol><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9137421263/original/coJEXdxrW5pXzYEPaIfN7kIWzLL6A2BCcw.png?1629385724\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9137421263\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165325\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165325/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165325\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165325/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165325\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div 